[statement]
As `a-condition-forbidding-a-name-the-package-provides-at-no-version-waits-for-the-package-itself`,
where the package is the only one providing the name its `!` entry
names: `c` needs `e`, `e` needs `pv`, and `s`, whose condition is `c` and
`!pv`, provides `pv` at no version, without a priority. `s` waits, `pv`
is decided before it with no candidate apk would choose, and apk
refuses.

[repository]
P:c
V:2
D:e

P:e
V:2
D:pv

P:s
V:1
p:pv
i:c !pv

